OL,3,AFaisal Islam: Why Jensen Huang proved  
OL,4,Atoo big to fire                        
OL,6,FThere have been three jaw-dropping     
OL,7,Fmoments in the past few hours around   
OL,8,FJensen Huang's reinstatement as Nvidia 
OL,9,Fchief executive after he admitted an   
OL,10,Faffair with a woman who was alleged to 
OL,11,Fbe a Chinese spy.                      
OL,13,FThe shock announcement of his return to
OL,14,Fthe chipmaker was followed by the      
OL,15,Faddition of one trillion dollars of    
OL,16,Fstock market value to Nvidia.          
OL,18,FThen it was the moment President Trump 
OL,19,Fadmitted the obvious: that it was his  
OL,20,F"You're unfired" message direct to the 
OL,21,Fboard that changed the decision.       
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
