OL,3,AFaisal Islam: Why Jensen Huang proved  
OL,4,Atoo big to fire                        
OL,6,FThe nature of the U-turn is clear from 
OL,7,Fwhat Nvidia was saying just last week. 
OL,8,FThe board was clear that Huang was not 
OL,9,Freturning.                             
